11. Security, privacy and reliability
OWASP top 10 covered: input validation (zod), output escaping, CSRF protection, secure cookies, rate limiting (login, OTP, checkout, APIs), file upload validation (type, size, image re-encode), SSRF protection on webhook URLs (block private IPs), secrets encrypted at rest (courier/payment/SMS keys), RBAC enforced on the server for every action.
The GTM/custom code boxes are owner-only and their content is logged in the audit log.
Daily backups, migration safety, idempotent payment/courier callbacks, job retries with dead-letter queue.
Privacy: consent mode, customer data export/delete, retention settings, hashed PII in outbound marketing data.
